[b]v1.4.1 — Panel scroll fix[/b]
[list]
[*]The text in the F6 panel no longer jumps to the end when it refreshes. It opens at the top (selected character and squad total visible right away) and keeps your scroll position while it updates. Reported by az455862.
[/list]
Requires RE_Kenshi v0.3.5+. Full changelog: [url=https://github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-achievements/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md]GitHub[/url]
